  <h2>2. Principle: as little data as possible</h2>
  <p>This website sets no cookies, uses no analytics or tracking services and loads no third-party content when you visit it. Fonts, images and code are served from our own server. The only exception is our video: it loads only when you open it yourself (section 7).</p>

  <h2>3. Server logs</h2>
  <p>When you visit the website, the web server stores technically necessary information: a shortened IP address (the last digits are removed before storage), date and time, the address requested, status code, amount of data transferred and the browser identifier. The purpose is secure and stable operation. The legal basis is Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR. Logs are deleted after seven days at the latest.</p>
