  <h2>4. Quick check and PDF report</h2>
  <p>The quick check runs entirely in your browser. Your answers, the result and any company name you enter are not transferred to us or to third parties and are not stored. The PDF report is also created locally in your browser. Closing the page deletes the information.</p>

  <h2>5. Demo request and contact by email</h2>
  <p>“Book a demo” opens a form. We process the details you enter there – company or organisation, first and last name, business email address and, if given, phone number – to answer your request and arrange a demo (Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR, pre-contractual steps). The details are sent as an email to {CONTACT_EMAIL}; they remain in our server's mail queue only until sent.</p>
  <p>To prevent abuse, we store the email address, IP address and time of each request in order to limit repeated automated requests (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR). These details are deleted automatically after 30 days. No CAPTCHA and no third-party service is used; we do not send you a confirmation email.</p>
  <p>If you write to us directly at {CONTACT_EMAIL}, we process your details for the same purpose.</p>
