  <h2>6. Signing in to the application</h2>
  <p>The “Sign in” button leads to the application at uniq.cyberwerk.online, which has its own privacy policy.</p>

  <h2 id="video">7. Video (bunny.net)</h2>
  <p>We embed our film using the Bunny Stream service of BunnyWay d.o.o., Dunajska cesta 165, 1000 Ljubljana, Slovenia. The player loads only when you start the film; until then no connection to bunny.net is made. The preview image is served from our own server. When you open it, your browser sends technically necessary information to bunny.net, in particular your IP address, browser identifier, date and time and the address of this page. The legal basis is your consent given by the click (Art. 6(1)(a) GDPR and Section 25(1) TDDDG); you can withdraw it at any time for the future by not opening the film again. Details are in the provider's privacy policy at <a href="https://bunny.net/privacy" rel="noopener noreferrer">bunny.net/privacy</a>.</p>
